# Aura needs no frontend environment variables.
# Server-side (Netlify -> Project configuration -> Environment variables), mark keys as secret.
# Set at least one; Gemini is tried first when both are present.
#   GEMINI_API_KEY=...                     Google AI Studio key (free tier)
#   HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=hf_...             Hugging Face token (backup)
#   GOOGLE_TTS_API_KEY=...                 optional: Google Cloud Text-to-Speech, faster voice for e.g. Malayalam
